    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a construction area prepared for a race, modern quadruped robots compete to reach the finish line first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must guide the  quadruped robot to overcome the obstacles and win the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your robot is smart and will try to cross the terrain following the target you have indicated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different areas (levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unlockable skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 unlockable power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against AI-controlled rival robots</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a construction area prepared for a race, modern quadruped robots compete to reach the finish line first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must guide the  quadruped robot to overcome the obstacles and win the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your robot is smart and will try to cross the terrain following the target you have indicated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different areas (levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unlockable skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 unlockable power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against AI-controlled rival robots</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Your quadruped robot has an incredible ability to navigate the most challenging terrains. Just give it a target, and win the race!",
